e":"lyrics"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"seed","name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":73},{"localized_name":"max_duration","name":"max_duration","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"max_duration"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"cfg_scale","name":"cfg_scale","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"cfg_scale"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"top_k","name":"top_k","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"top_k"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"条件","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[65,68]},{"localized_name":"seconds","name":"seconds","type":"FLOAT","links":[66]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.31.0","Node name for S&R":"MiniMaxMusic3TextEncode"},"widgets_values":["futuristic electronic pop, ethereal cyber atmosphere, mid-tempo, philosophical lyric, cold warm contrast vocal\nCaption\nMid-tempo futuristic electronic pop track at 90 BPM in 4/4 time signature, featuring ethereal cyber synth layers, soft digital pad foundations, crisp electronic drum beats and subtle glitch sound effects throughout the whole song. Adopts pure young female vocal with clear, calm and rational timbre, paired with mild reverb and delay audio processing. The track builds a progressive emotional arc from quiet confused intro to powerful insightful chorus, with minimalist bass lines supporting the rhythm. The overall mood is cold yet sober, expressing the collision between outdated traditional cognition and futuristic technological iteration, highlighting individual independent choice and the irreversible trend of era evolution. The complete structure includes ambient intro, narrative verses, uplifting chorus, atmospheric bridge and gradual fading outro.","[Intro - Ethereal cyber synth pad fades in, subtle digital glitch sound, no drum beat, empty futuristic ambient]\n(ooh, mm)\n[Verse 1 - Soft digital bass, light electronic rim clicks, sustained synth background, slow steady rhythm]\n(calm, rational vocal delivery, low and gentle tone)\n旧的框架困着世俗眼光\n固守过往 否定所有新生向往\n他们不懂时代迭代的方向\n困在人情伦理 原地彷徨\n技术撕开陈旧的围墙\n个体选择 本就该自由坦荡\n不必辩解 不必勉强兼容体谅\n认知鸿沟 本就无需勉强\n[Chorus - Full electronic drum kicks, layered synth chords, rich ambient texture, elevated vocal pitch]\n(clear powerful vocal, steady and firm emotion)\n未来从不会为平庸退让\n新旧更替 是世间不变的篇章\n挣脱枷锁 挣脱世俗捆绑\n我的人生 由我亲自丈量\n科技生长 打破固有过往\n所有选择 皆是本心的坦荡\n不必迎合 愚昧的世俗立场\n新生浪潮 终将席卷四方\n[Verse 2 - Slightly enhanced drum rhythm, faint arpeggio synth, continuous bass progression]\n(softer narrative vocal, calm and insightful)\n婚姻从不是生命的围墙\n生育权利 该归个体自主执掌\n优生的光 穿透灰色乱象\n技术向善 解锁全新远方\n有人固守旧时代的寻常\n有人奔赴新纪元的晴朗\n不随浪潮 本就是个人信仰\n时代前行 从不会为谁停航\n[Chorus - Full electronic drum kicks, layered synth chords, rich ambient texture, elevated vocal pitch]\n(clear powerful vocal, steady and firm emotion)\n未来从不会为平庸退让\n新旧更替 是世间不变的篇章\n挣脱枷锁 挣脱世俗捆绑\n我的人生 由我亲自丈量\n科技生长 打破固有过往\n所有选择 皆是本心的坦荡\n不必迎合 愚昧的世俗立场\n新生浪潮 终将席卷四方\n[Bridge - Drum beat fades temporarily, dreamy wide reverb synth, gentle piano single notes]\n(breathy ethereal vocal, soft and distant tone)\n那些看不懂的 终将被时光安放\n那些守不住的 旧序终将退场\n文明迭代 从无永恒模样\n拥抱新生 才是唯一方向\n[Instrumental Solo - Bright lead synth solo, steady electronic rhythm, layered ambient background]\n[Chorus - Full instrumental layering, strongest vocal dynamics, full drum arrangement]\n(passionate and firm vocal, full emotional output)\n未来从不会为平庸退让\n新旧更替 是世间不变的篇章\n挣脱枷锁 挣脱世俗捆绑\n我的人生 由我亲自丈量\n科技生长 打破固有过往\n所有选择 皆是本心的坦荡\n不必迎合 愚昧的世俗立场\n新生浪潮 终将席卷四方\n[Outro - Instruments fade layer by layer, synth pad echoes faintly, glitch sound gradually disappears, ultimate quiet ambient]\n(soft fading vocal echo, distant ooh sound)",222,"fixed",60,1.7,50]}],"links":[[64,45,0,54,0,"CLIP"],[65,54,0,47,0,"CONDITIONING"],[66,54,1,48,0,"FLOAT"],[67,44,0,49,0,"MODEL"],[68,54,0,49,1,"CONDITIONING"],[69,47,0,49,2,"CONDITIONING"],[70,48,0,49,3,"LATENT"],[73,51,0,54,3,"INT"],[74,51,0,49,4,"INT"],[75,49,0,52,0,"LATENT"],[76,46,0,52,1,"VAE"],[81,56,2,57,0,"AUDIO"],[82,52,0,56,0,"AUDIO"]],"groups":[],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":1.7037920545635732,"of